{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"Elias sat rigidly against the window, the glass fogged by his cold breath. Outside, the landscape was a blur of midnight black and the occasional streak of sodium light from passing towns. He watched his own reflection in the dark pane—a pale, haggard face that looked older than his thirty-two years. In his coat pocket, his fingers found the edge of the folded paper, its corners soft and worn from constant checking. He didn’t open it. He didn’t need to; every word was burned into his memory, a script he had memorized in the weeks leading up to this journey. The train jolted softly as it hit a switch, a metallic groan that vibrated through the floor and into his bones. Across the aisle, a woman snored lightly, her head resting on a child’s head, both of them lost in a dreamless sleep. Elias turned back to the window, watching the darkness swallow the flickering lights of the world he was leaving behind, waiting for the next link in the chain to appear in the distance.","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1792460766,"id":"chatcmpl-18e0199200c5c8810067","model":"qwen3.8-27b-fp8","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"aien_sampling":{"greedy_tokens":0,"kept":[248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,2